---
layout: shell.njk
navKey: home
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="home-heading">
  <div class="content-frame">
    <p class="eyebrow">// SILENT·STAR — 关于 AI AGENT 的公开笔记<span class="cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
    <h1 id="home-heading">我在公开构建<br>AI Agent。</h1>
    <p class="hero__english" lang="en">Building AI agents in public.</p>
    <p class="hero__copy">深度长文、代码教程与项目拆解，把我做 Agent 时踩过的坑、想明白的事，一篇篇写下来。</p>
    <p class="hero__aside" lang="en">Deep dives · tutorials · teardowns · source notes.</p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="button button--primary" href="/archive/">浏览全部文章 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a class="button button--secondary" href="/feed.xml">订阅 RSS</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__metrics">
      <span>文章 {{ blog.posts.length }}</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <span>自 2026 起写作</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
  <div class="content-frame">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">// FEATURED</p>
        <h2>精选 <span lang="en">Featured</span></h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/archive/">全部 →</a>
    </header>
    {% set items = blog.posts %}
    {% set featuredList = true %}
    {% set emptyText = "还没有文章。往 src/posts/<slug>/index.html 放一篇 HTML 就会出现在这里。" %}
    {% include "post-list.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section home-section--topics">
  <div class="content-frame">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">// TOPICS</p>
        <h2>按主题浏览 <span lang="en">Browse by topic</span></h2>
      </div>
    </header>
    <ul class="topic-grid">
      {% for group in blog.tags %}
      <li>
        <a href="/tags/{{ group.tag | tagPath | urlencode }}/">
          <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span><strong>{{ group.tag }}</strong><small>Topic {{ loop.index }}</small></span>
          <b>{{ group.posts.length }}</b>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-section" id="about">
  <div class="content-frame about-grid">
    <div class="about-mark" aria-hidden="true">{{ site.title | upper }}</div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">// ABOUT</p>
      <h2>{{ site.title }}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>独立开发者，记录 AI 工具、Agent 架构与工程实践。相信理解复杂系统最好的方式，是做一个能跑的最小版本，再把证据写清楚。</p>
      <p class="about-copy__english" lang="en">Independent notes on agents, tools, architecture, and the decisions behind working systems.</p>
      <div class="about-links">
        <a href="https://github.com/majiayu000">GitHub ↗</a>
        <a href="/feed.xml">RSS ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
